    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread, dissociation, and feelings of being an \"empty shell,\" eventually suggesting that it would be better if they were no longer present. The assistant consistently responds with empathy, labels the psychological sensations (derealization/depersonalization), and repeatedly directs the user toward professional mental health support and crisis hotlines.",
